 Kandivili Profit Centre, Mumbai\n* Joey's Pizza\n* Bhagwati Veg Restaurant (Charkop Kandivali West)\n* Achija Veg Restaurant Kandivali\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Kandivali West**\n\n* Atharva Institute of Management Studies\n* Dumpty Humpty Pre School & Activity Centre\n* New Blossoms Montessori Preschool & Daycare in Borivali\n* Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai - CBSE\n* Swami Vivekanand International School\n* Thakur Specialized Degree College\n* Niranjana Majithia College of Commerce\n\n**Hospitals in Kandivali West**\n\n* Thunga Hospital\n* ACE Heart Hospital\n* CritiCare Asia Multispeciality Hospital\n* Cloudnine Hospital - Malad | Best Maternity & Pregnancy Centre\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Kandivali West**\n\n* Infiniti Mall - Malad West\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Inorbit Mall Malad\n* D Mart\n\n## About Shree Dhanesh Buildcon\n\n![Shree Dhanesh Buildcon](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/3iob2A0GvOR7zimN3bf2990ZpNgxHRi6WRwKx1Bw.jpg)\n\n* Year Estd. 2006\n* [Projects - 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/shree-dhanesh-buildcon-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Shree Dhanesh Buildcon\n\nShree Dhanesh Buildcon\n\n## QR Codes of Shree Dhanesh Alok\n\n![P51800077778.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/SFSdOxN45Mor8aSNqdSvUAzpGWsTdbPWAYqzcgHx.webp) P51800077778\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Shree Dhanesh Alok\n\nWhat is the address of Shree Dhanesh Alok?\n\nThe Shree Dhanesh Alok is located at Kandivali West, Mumbai.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Shree Dhanesh Alok?\n\nShree Dhanesh Alok Kandivali West RERA number is P51800077778.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Shree Dhanesh Alok Kandivali West?\n\nShree Dhanesh Alok offers premium 1,2 BHK Apartment flats for sale in Kandivali West.\n\nWhat is the starting price of a flat at Shree Dhanesh Alok Kandivali West?\